  "comment": "Calamaris is a Perl script which generates nice statistics out of Squid or Oops log files. It is invoked daily before the proxy rotates its log files, and mails the statistics or puts them on the web. Various options are supported for generated reports; some extra features require the suggested Perl modules. Contents 1 Instalasi 2 Konfigurasi 3 Referensi 4 Pranala Menarik Instalasi apt-get",
